ent-WFAsfAirlockBridge = ASF bridge airlock
ent-WFAsfAirlockSecurity = ASF security airlock
ent-WFAsfLockerSecurity = ASF security locker
    .desc = A locker for Enforcer gear. Needs ASF security access.
ent-WFAsfVoucherCivilian = ASF civilian LPC
    .desc = A small card that authorizes the procurement of one ASF Gleaner, Porter or Lamplighter. Redeemable at an ASF shipyard console. Destroyed on use.
ent-WFAsfVoucherEscort = ASFN escort LPC
    .desc = A small card that authorizes the procurement of one ASFN Vigil or Bulwark. Redeemable at an ASF shipyard console. Destroyed on use.
ent-WFAsfVoucherLodestar = ASFN Lodestar LPC
    .desc = A small card that authorizes the procurement of an ASFN Lodestar-class frigate. Lodestars can't be bought with credits. Destroyed on use.
ent-WFAsfShieldGenerator = FS-421V "Bastion" Outpost Shield Generator
    .desc = The Bastion. An FS-421 retuned by the Federation to project a violet field. Same durability, same appetite for power.
ent-WFAsfResearchServer = ASF R&D server
    .desc = Stores Lantern Post's research, ship LPC designs included.
ent-WFAsfLathe = ASF fabricator
    .desc = Prints ASF ship LPCs, coilguns, field modsuits and shipgun ammo from researched designs.

